---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:32px;max-width:760px;min-height:50vh">
    <h1 class="serif" style="font-size:48px;margin:0 0 16px">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.65">[PLACEHOLDER: your privacy policy. It must explain that lead form details (name, email, phone, wedding date, guest count, budget, message) are shared with the vendors a couple contacts or is matched with, how long data is kept, and how to request deletion. Have this reviewed by a lawyer before launch.]</p>
  </main>
</Base>
